<view class="page"><view class="card"><text class="title">智能排码 · 前四位</text><view class="muted">与网站同一套规则，从0000–9999完整计算。结果仅用于统计研究。</view><button class="btn" bindtap="calculate" loading="{{busy}}">重新计算号码池</button></view><view class="card"><view class="stats"><view class="stat"><text class="muted">原码池</text><text class="value">{{allCount}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text class="muted">无对子</text><text class="value">{{uniqueCount}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text class="muted">普通单对子</text><text class="value">{{pairCount}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text class="muted">历史期数</text><text class="value">{{historyCount}}</text></view></view><view class="muted">动态排码：{{banned}}</view></view><view class="card"><picker mode="selector" range="{{types}}" value="{{typeIndex}}" bindchange="changeType"><view class="pill">当前：{{types[typeIndex]}} ▼</view></picker><view class="row" style="margin:20rpx 0"><text class="muted">分批复制（每批约四分之一）</text><button size="mini" class="btn" bindtap="copy">复制当前批</button></view><view class="row"><button size="mini" bindtap="prev">上一批</button><text>第{{batchNum}}/4批</text><button size="mini" bindtap="next">下一批</button></view><scroll-view scroll-y style="height:550rpx;margin-top:20rpx"><text class="number" selectable>{{preview}}</text></scroll-view></view></view>